<p dir=3D"auto">The detailed description:
After using my ASUS Vivobook Pro for about a year, I switched from=20
Windows 11 to Fedora Linux 44 7.1.3 a week ago. I never had any problems
 on Windows 11. Since then, I have been getting crashes after several=20
hours of not restarting. Leaving the computer on overnight will cause a=20
crash 1-2 minutes after logging in. I have gone through multiple steps=20
